Package: pdrive-desktop
Version: 0.1.3
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, libsecret-1-0
Maintainer: PDrive Desktop contributors
Description: Private and native Proton Drive experience for Linux
 PDrive Desktop provides a polished GTK interface for browsing, uploading,
 downloading, organizing, and safely backing up Proton Drive files on Linux.
 Authentication uses Proton's official browser flow: PDrive never receives or
 stores account passwords. There is no PDrive backend, analytics service, or
 advertising network, and destructive operations always require confirmation.
XB-AppName: PDrive Desktop
XB-Icon: pdrive-desktop
XB-Category: Network
